# Tor SOCKS5 Proxy Configuration for Fortune Protocol G
# Routes outbound RPC calls through rotating exit nodes

# SOCKS5 listener — accessible only within Docker network
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050

# Rotate circuits aggressively for IP hopping
MaxCircuitDirtiness 60
NewCircuitPeriod 60
CircuitBuildTimeout 30

# Performance tuning for RPC calls
NumEntryGuards 4
KeepalivePeriod 60

# Disable exit policy (we only use Tor as a client, not a relay)
ExitPolicy reject *:*

# Run as daemon in foreground (Docker best practice)
RunAsDaemon 0

# Logging
Log notice stdout
